<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>Business Outlook<SUP>2</SUP></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">For the second quarter of 2026, the Company projects revenue of $185
million to $195 million. Non-GAAP gross margin is projected in a range of 49% to 50%. Adjusted EBITDA is projected in a range of $9 million
to $14 million.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The Company&rsquo;s outlook is based on current indications for its
business, which are subject to change.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><SUP>2</SUP> GAAP earnings guidance is not provided. Please see the
reconciliations of non-GAAP financial measures to the most directly comparable GAAP measures and additional information about the non-GAAP
measures in the section entitled &ldquo;Discussion of Non-GAAP Financial Measures&rdquo; in the attached schedules.</P>

